## Notes

- `just build` verifies the workspace build on the current host platform.
- `just lint` covers Rust checks, Clippy, frontend build, LOC, doc snippets, and example wiring validation.
- `just quality-docker` builds the standalone CLI and web Docker images, then runs them.

